# dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored: action.yml's runs.main points at
# dist/index.js (the ncc-bundled output, built via
# `npx @vercel/ncc build src/index.js -o dist`), and this action must be
# self-contained for external users -- nothing runs `npm install` for a
# consumer referencing this repo via `uses:`. Rebuild and commit dist/
# after any change to src/.
